inejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"2\" d=\"M4 6h16M4 12h16M4 18h16\"></path></svg></button></div></header><main id=\"main-content\" class=\"pt-16\"><section class=\"relative bg-navy py-24 px-4 overflow-hidden scanlines\"><svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none \" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"opacity:0.1\"><defs><pattern id=\"circuit-grid\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"80\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"80\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"80\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"40\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"40\" r=\"1\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><line x1=\"30\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></line><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"1.2\"></line><line x1=\"55\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><line x1=\"65\" y1=\"30\" x2=\"65\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"40\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"65\" cy=\"30\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"25\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><line x1=\"15\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"15\" y2=\"50\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"40\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"15\" cy=\"50\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle></pattern></defs><rect width=\"100%\" height=\"100%\" fill=\"url(#circuit-grid)\"></rect></svg><div class=\"absolute top-1/3 right-1/4 w-80 h-80 bg-teal/10 rounded-full blur-[120px] pointer-events-none\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-4xl mx-auto text-center\"><p class=\"section-label mb-4\">// FREE RESOURCES</p><h1 class=\"font-display text-white text-4xl md:text-5xl font-black leading-tight mb-6 text-glow\">Start Learning for Free</h1><p class=\"font-body text-teal-lt text-xl mb-4 leading-relaxed max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Every template, guide, and reference card below is free — no strings attached. Build your foundation first. The paid course is there when you&#x27;re ready to go deeper.</p><p class=\"font-body text-gray-500 text-sm\">No credit card. No sales call. Just practitioner-level content you can use today.</p></div></section><section class=\"bg-light-bg py-20 px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><p class=\"section-label mb-3\">// FREE DOWNLOADS &amp; GUIDES</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-navy text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-4\">Templates &amp; Reference Guides</h2><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-lg max-w-2xl mx-auto\">Built for real engagements and real organizations. Use them as-is or adapt them to your context.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-7 border border-divider hover:border-teal/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-teal/5 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-lg font-bold leading-tight\">AI Security Risk Overview</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 font-display text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border bg-teal/20 text-teal-lt border-teal/30\">PDF Download</span></div><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">A one-page breakdown of the 5 critical AI security risks facing organizations today — with severity ratings and the questions every practitioner should be asking. Used by 500+ security professionals.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-display text-sm font-bold text-teal hover:text-teal-lt transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal rounded-md\" href=\"/free-risk-overview\">Get the Free PDF<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-7 border border-divider hover:border-teal/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-teal/5 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-lg font-bold leading-tight\">AI Acceptable Use Policy Template</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 font-display text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border bg-teal/20 text-teal-lt border-teal/30\">Free Template</span></div><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">A complete, editable AUP template covering scope, prohibited uses, approved tools, data handling rules, and enforcement. Built to be dropped straight into a real engagement or your own organization.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-display text-sm font-bold text-teal hover:text-teal-lt transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal rounded-md\" href=\"/blog/how-to-write-an-ai-acceptable-use-policy\">Read the Guide + Template<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-7 border border-divider hover:border-teal/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-teal/5 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-lg font-bold leading-tight\">Shadow AI Discovery Guide</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 font-display text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border bg-teal/20 text-teal-lt border-teal/30\">Free Guide</span></div><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">A step-by-step guide to finding unauthorized AI tools inside an organization — including DNS/proxy log analysis, browser audits, and intake questionnaire techniques. With a free discovery checklist.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-display text-sm font-bold text-teal hover:text-teal-lt transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal rounded-md\" href=\"/blog/shadow-ai-what-it-is-why-its-dangerous-and-how-to-find-it\">Read the Guide<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-xl p-7 border border-divider hover:border-teal/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-teal/5 transition-all group\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-4 mb-4\"><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-lg font-bold leading-tight\">OWASP LLM Top 10 Reference Card</h3><span class=\"shrink-0 font-display text-xs font-bold px-3 py-1 rounded-full border bg-teal/20 text-teal-lt border-teal/30\">Free Reference</span></div><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed mb-6\">All 10 LLM security risks explained in plain practitioner language — what each risk means, a real-world example, and how to assess it in an engagement. Bookmark this one.</p><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 font-display text-sm font-bold text-teal hover:text-teal-lt transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal rounded-md\" href=\"/blog/owasp-llm-top-10-what-every-security-pro-needs-to-know\">Read the Guide<span aria-hidden=\"true\">→</span></a></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-teal py-16 px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-5xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-10 items-center\"><div><p class=\"section-label text-white/70 mb-3\">// FREE RESOURCE</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-white text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold mb-4 leading-tight\">Download the Free AI Security Risk Overview</h2><p class=\"font-body text-teal-bg text-lg mb-6\">The 5 critical AI risks explained in plain language — with severity ratings, real examples, and the questions every practitioner should be asking. Free PDF, no spam.</p><form class=\"space-y-3\"><div class=\"flex gap-3\"><input type=\"text\" placeholder=\"First name\" class=\"w-1/3 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/30 text-white placeholder-white/50 font-body text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white\" value=\"\"/><input type=\"email\" required=\"\" placeholder=\"Email address\" class=\"flex-1 px-4 py-3 rounded-lg bg-white/10 border border-white/30 text-white placeholder-white/50 font-body text-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white\" value=\"\"/></div><button type=\"submit\" class=\"w-full bg-navy hover:bg-navy/80 text-teal-lt font-display font-bold text-sm py-3 rounded-lg tracking-wide transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-white disabled:opacity-60\">Download Free Risk Overview →</button><p class=\"text-xs text-teal-bg/70 font-body text-center\">No spam. Unsubscribe any time. Your data is never sold.</p></form></div><div class=\"flex justify-center\"><div class=\"relative w-60 h-80 bg-navy rounded-xl border-2 border-teal-lt/40 flex flex-col items-center justify-center shadow-2xl\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 opacity-20 rounded-xl overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"h-px bg-teal-lt my-8 mx-4\"></div><div class=\"h-px bg-teal-lt my-8 mx-4\"></div><div class=\"h-px bg-teal-lt my-8 mx-4\"></div><div class=\"h-px bg-teal-lt my-8 mx-4\"></div><div class=\"h-px bg-teal-lt my-8 mx-4\"></div><div class=\"h-px bg-teal-lt my-8 mx-4\"></div><div class=\"h-px bg-teal-lt my-8 mx-4\"></div><div class=\"h-px bg-teal-lt my-8 mx-4\"></div></div><span class=\"text-5xl mb-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\">🛡️</span><p class=\"font-display text-teal-lt text-xs font-bold text-center px-4 leading-tight\">AI SECURITY<br/>RISK OVERVIEW</p><p class=\"font-body text-white/50 text-xs mt-2\">AITrustAudit.com</p></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-white py-20 px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><p class=\"section-label mb-3\">// COMING SOON</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-navy text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">More Free Tools on the Way</h2><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto\">Subscribe to the newsletter to be notified when these drop.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6\"><div class=\"relative bg-light-bg rounded-xl p-7 border border-divider border-dashed\"><div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 font-display text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-divider\">Soon</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-3 pr-12\">6-Domain Audit Workbook</h3><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed\">The full audit workbook used in the course — adapted for a free starter version.</p></div><div class=\"relative bg-light-bg rounded-xl p-7 border border-divider border-dashed\"><div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 font-display text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-divider\">Soon</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-3 pr-12\">Vendor Risk Questionnaire</h3><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed\">A ready-to-send questionnaire for evaluating AI vendor security posture.</p></div><div class=\"relative bg-light-bg rounded-xl p-7 border border-divider border-dashed\"><div class=\"absolute top-4 right-4 font-display text-xs font-bold text-gray-400 bg-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded-full border border-divider\">Soon</div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-3 pr-12\">AI Tool Inventory Template</h3><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm leading-relaxed\">A spreadsheet template for cataloguing every AI tool in use across an organization.</p></div></div></div></section><section class=\"bg-light-bg py-20 px-4\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto\"><div class=\"text-center mb-12\"><p class=\"section-label mb-3\">// FREE ARTICLES</p><h2 class=\"font-display text-navy text-3xl font-bold mb-4\">Practitioner-Level Reading</h2><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-lg max-w-xl mx-auto\">No email required. Just open and read.</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mb-8\"><a class=\"group block bg-white rounded-xl border border-divider overflow-hidden hover:border-teal transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal focus:ring-offset-2\" href=\"/blog/complete-ai-security-audit-guide-2026\"><div class=\"h-1\" style=\"background-color:#E65100\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#E651001A;color:#E65100\">Practitioner How-Tos</span><span class=\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-teal/10 text-teal border border-teal/30\">+ Template</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-2 leading-snug group-hover:text-teal transition-colors\">The Complete AI Security Audit Guide for 2026</h3><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3 leading-relaxed\">A practitioner&#x27;s walkthrough of everything you need to conduct a comprehensive AI security audit — from scoping the engagement to delivering the report. Covers NIST AI RMF, OWASP LLM Top 10, and the 6-Domain methodology.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-body text-mid-gray/60\"><span>Jamel Rainey</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span>14 min read</span><span>May 2026</span></div></div></div></a><a class=\"group block bg-white rounded-xl border border-divider overflow-hidden hover:border-teal transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal focus:ring-offset-2\" href=\"/blog/nist-ai-rmf-explained\"><div class=\"h-1\" style=\"background-color:#00796B\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#00796B1A;color:#00796B\">Framework Guides</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-2 leading-snug group-hover:text-teal transition-colors\">NIST AI RMF 1.0 Explained in Plain English</h3><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3 leading-relaxed\">The NIST AI Risk Management Framework is the federal government&#x27;s guidance for managing AI risk. Here&#x27;s what it actually says, how it&#x27;s structured, and how to apply it in a real audit context — without the government-document fog.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-body text-mid-gray/60\"><span>Jamel Rainey</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span>9 min read</span><span>May 2026</span></div></div></div></a><a class=\"group block bg-white rounded-xl border border-divider overflow-hidden hover:border-teal transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-lg focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal focus:ring-offset-2\" href=\"/blog/how-to-write-ai-acceptable-use-policy\"><div class=\"h-1\" style=\"background-color:#E65100\"></div><div class=\"p-6\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 mb-3\"><span class=\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full\" style=\"background-color:#E651001A;color:#E65100\">Practitioner How-Tos</span><span class=\"font-display text-xs font-bold px-2.5 py-0.5 rounded-full bg-teal/10 text-teal border border-teal/30\">+ Template</span></div><h3 class=\"font-display text-navy text-base font-bold mb-2 leading-snug group-hover:text-teal transition-colors\">How to Write an AI Acceptable Use Policy (Free Template)</h3><p class=\"font-body text-mid-gray text-sm mb-4 line-clamp-3 leading-relaxed\">73% of SMBs have no written AI Acceptable Use Policy. Here&#x27;s what needs to be in one, why it matters legally, and a free template you can adapt for your organization.</p><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs font-body text-mid-gray/60\"><span>Jamel Rainey</span><div class=\"flex items-center gap-3\"><span>8 min read</span><span>May 2026</span></div></div></div></a></div><div class=\"text-center\"><a class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-display text-sm font-bold text-teal hover:text-teal-lt transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-teal rounded-md\" href=\"/blog\">View all articles →</a></div></div></section><section class=\"relative bg-navy py-20 px-4 overflow-hidden\"><svg class=\"absolute inset-0 w-full h-full pointer-events-none \" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" aria-hidden=\"true\" style=\"opacity:0.08\"><defs><pattern id=\"circuit-grid\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" patternUnits=\"userSpaceOnUse\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"40\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"40\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"0\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"80\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"40\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"40\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00ACC1\" stroke-width=\"0.8\"></line><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><line x1=\"80\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"80\" y2=\"80\" stroke=\"#00796B\" stroke-width=\"0.5\"></line><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"40\" r=\"2.5\" fill=\"#00ACC1\"></circle><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"0\" cy=\"80\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"80\" r=\"1.5\" fill=\"#00796B\"></circle><circle cx=\"40\" cy=\"0\" r=\"1\" fill=